y as <span style=\"color:red\"><u><b>Mind</b></u></span> dots of Skald.<br /> <b>Optional 2:</b> Death 1<br /> Instant cast <i>Know Ghost </i>( analogical to <i>Know Spirit</i> ) with Potency as <span style=\"color:red\"><u><b>Mind</b></u></span> dots of Skald.<br /> <b>Optional 3:</b> Time 1<br /> Instant cast <i>Perfect Timing</i>, preparing Skald for best starting performance.<br /> <br /> <b>Second Attainment: Soothe the Beast</b><br /> <b>Prerequisites: </b>Gnosis 2, Mind 2, Expression 3<br /> Skald can move people by his Art. Simply letting them to listen to his performance, he can use <i>Emotional Urging</i> on any listener of him, changing their minds to only one target state. It takes scene to use, but targeted listeners are under it\u2019s with Advanced Duration equal to his Mind dots.<br /> <br /> <b>Optional 1:</b> Spirit 2<br /> Scene cast <i>Command Spirit </i>with Potency and Advance Duration equal to <span style=\"color:red\"><u><b>Death</b></u></span> dots of Skald.<br /> <b>Optional 2:</b> Death 2<br /> Scene cast <i>Touch of the Grave</i> for Advance Duration equal to Death dots of Skald.<br /> <b>Optional 3:</b> Time 2<br /> Scene cast <i>Postcognition</i> on audience, with Potency as Time dots of Skald. Listeners are thinking they are imaging visions they see themselves by moving art of Skald.<br /> <br /> <b>Third Attainment: Pride Goeth Before</b><br /> <b>Prerequisites:</b> Gnosis 4, Mind 3, Expression 3, Secondary Skill at 3<br /> Many times, it is not enough to make a person feel shame at their actions. The Hierarch may know the feelings to be false, or she may discard the emotion as a mere twinge of the conscience. When a person cannot be made to repent, it is the Skald\u2019s duty to force that person to admit fault and accept punishment, or leave for the better of the Consilium. Using this Attainment requires the Skald to perform a critical song or poem, or to plan and put on a satirical mummery or a play. In some way, he must communicate to the intended target and to those around her the failings and flaws they should see. Target has changed one of his Aspirations to \u2018Repent for mistakes\u2019 for the Advanced Duration equal to Mind dots of Skald. Attainment cast in the performance scene.<br /> <br /> <b>Optional 1:</b> Spirit 3<br /> Scene cast <i>Place of Power </i>with Potency and Advanced Duration equal to Spirit dots of Skald.<br /> <b>Optional 2:</b> Death 3<br /> Scene cast <i>Resolve Anchor </i>with Potency equal to Death dots of Skald.<br /> <b>Resolve Anchor</b> (Death \u2022\u2022\u2022)<br /> <b>Practice:</b> Fraying<br /> <b>Primary Factor:</b> Potency<br /> <b>Withstand:</b> Ghost\u2019s Rank<br /> <b>Suggested Rote Skills:</b> Academics, Occult, Expression<br /> Merciful Disciples of Death can make ghosts free of their existence burden and just unravel their connection to material world, one by one, letting them pass to Afterlife. It works as taking out Anchors of ghost in question. Each connection is treated as one Target for the spell, so mage is taking multiple of them by rising Scale Factor. Note that sorcerer only destroys ghosts connection to Anchor, not the Anchor itself \u2013 so shades can be sure nothing bad will happen to their close ones or the things close to their life. Mage is aware of Anchors being over ghost, but to know where they are connected, he needs to use spells like <i>Know Ghost</i>.<br /> <b>Optional 3:</b> Time 3<br /> Scene cast <i>Constant Presence</i> with Advanced Duration and Advanced Scale as Time dots of Skald.<br /> <br /> <b>Fourth Attainment: Hearing the Kind Piper<br /> Prerequisites:</b> Gnosis 6, Mind 4, Expression 4<br /> Finally, some societies are too sick with corruption to do their own healing, or too weak-willed to correct the ill tendencies of neglectful superiors. When that is the case, the Skalds must drive people to cure themselves, to do what they are otherwise unwilling to do and begin the process of recovery. This Attainment requires an instant action to perform, and its power carries through an appropriate recitation or song. Woven through the art is a deeply concealed, strong mental suggestion.<br /> It works as scene cast <i>Psychic Domination</i> with +2 Reach option of total control on target for fulfilling command up to Advanced Duration in Mind dots of Skald. Commanding people in this way is not obvious. Observers perceive the singing or the poetry, and then the target of the Attainment acts.<br /> <br /> <b>Optional 1:</b> Spirit 4<br /> Scene cast <i>Spirit Summons</i> with +1 Reach simple command option, +1 Reach option to summon from across Gauntlet, Potency and Duration equal to Spirit dots of Skald.<br /> <b>Optional 2:</b> Death 4<br /> Scene cast<i> Exorcism</i> with +1 Reach on preventing recreation of Conditions with Potency and Duration equal to Death dots of Skald.<br /> <b>Optional 3:</b> Time 4<br /> Scene cast <i>Temporal Summoning</i> with Advanced Duration and Potency equal to Time dots of Skald.<br /> <br /> <b>Fifth Attainment: Catharsis<br /> Prerequisites:</b> Gnosis 8, Mind 5, Expression 4, Secondary Skill at 4<br /> Skalds Art move listeners so much, it literally change who they are. It works as <i>Psychic Reprogramming</i> cast on his audience, with Potency equal to his Mind dots. Changes are the same for each listener. Attainment is cast in scene.<br /> <br /> <b>Optional 1:</b> Spirit 5<br /> Scene cast <i>Shape Spirit</i>, by changing story of the being. It has Potency and Advanced Duration equal to Spirit dots of Skald.<br /> <b>Optional 2:</b> Death 5<br /> Scene cast <i>Destroy Ghost</i>. Skalds believe they freeing damned souls by this.<br /> <b>Destroy Ghost</b> (Death \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022)<br /> <b>Practice:</b> Unmaking<br /> <b>Primary Factor:</b> Potency<br /> <b>Withstand:</b> Rank<br /> <b>Suggested Rote Skills:</b> Intimidation, Science, Weaponry<br /> The most fearsome spell in most necromancer\u2019s arsenal, this terrible magic utterly destroys a ghost. The target ghost may spend an Essence to roll Power + Finesse in a Clash of Wills, a last ditch attempt to reassert its existence through its Influences. If the spell is successfully cast, the spirit is instantly and utterly destroyed \u2014 even if it still has Essence, it does not retreat into hibernation, it is simply gone. Short of archmastery, this spell cannot affect ghosts of Rank 6 or higher.<br /> <b>Optional 3: </b>Time 5<br /> Scene cast <i>Temporal Summoning</i> using Temporal Sympathy with Advanced Duration and Potency equal to Time dots of Skald.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12802-hardwire99","name":"Hardwire99","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-02T11:15:41-08:00","id":1025499,"title":"","content":"Spirit 1 should use Know Spirit with Potency of dots in Spirit, not Mind, same goes for Death 1 Know Ghost. <br /> <br /> Spirit 2 should be based on Spirit dots not Death. <br /> Upon further reflection I don't think that use of Postcognition works the way you intend. As written it doesn't employ Temporal or Sympathetic mechanics so the only thing the audience can be shown is the past 24-ish hours of the location that the show is occurring in. <br /> <br /> The Mind 3 attainment is still using a 4th dot effect for some reason. <br /> Time 3 I'm not sure how that ties into reliving the glorious past either, I suppose it keeps the glorious past from being changed but since it only works on your present self it's assuming that you are the glorious past as you perform which is obviously counter-intuitive to the purpose of the legacy. <br /> <br /> Fourth Mind attainment is still using too much Reach, I recommend dropping the Instant Activation. <br /> Spirit 4 can't work that way, you only get one Primary Factor and that's Duration = to Spirit dots, Potency can only be equal to half of Spirit rounded down (I think, it may be rounded up). So it will only work on Rank 1 Spirits (Unless I'm wrong and it's rounded up in which case it will work on Rank 2 spirits as well). <br /> <br /> Spirit 5 doesn't work for the same reason that Spirit 4 doesn't work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-02T11:41:29-08:00","id":1025508,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1025175-2e-fan-skalds?p=1025499#post1025499\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Spirit 1 should use Know Spirit with Potency of dots in Spirit, not Mind, same goes for Death 1 Know Ghost.<br /> <br /> Spirit 2 should be based on Spirit dots not Death.</div> </div> </div> </div>Will be changed in next iteration of Attainments.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1025175-2e-fan-skalds?p=1025499#post1025499\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Upon further reflection I don't think that use of Postcognition works the way you intend. As written it doesn't employ Temporal or Sympathetic mechanics so the only thing the audience can be shown is the past 24-ish hours of the location that the show is occurring in.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, we can use Temporal Sympathies with a spell as it is - Temporal Attainment does not use Reach, from the rules as written.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1025175-2e-fan-skalds?p=1025499#post1025499\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Mind 3 attainment is still using a 4th dot effect for some reason.</div> </div> </div> </div>And, as I pointed - it's taken as 1E power in the unique Attainement rule. It's also <b>much</b> weaker than 4th dot Mind spell you have in mind as it is limited to and only Aspiration change.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1025175-2e-fan-skalds?p=1025499#post1025499\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Time 3 I'm not sure how that ties into reliving the glorious past either, I suppose it keeps the glorious past from being changed but since it only works on your present self it's assuming that you are the glorious past as you perform which is obviously counter-intuitive to the purpose of the legacy.</div> </div> </div> </div>Made performance at site you want to preserve. Make sure it's past will be not changed.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1025175-2e-fan-skalds?p=1025499#post1025499\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fourth Mind attainment is still using too much Reach, I recommend dropping the Instant Activation.</div> </div> </div> </div>Will be changed in next iteration of Attainments.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1025175-2e-fan-skalds?p=1025499#post1025499\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Spirit 4 can't work that way, you only get one Primary Factor and that's Duration = to Spirit dots, Potency can only be equal to half of Spirit rounded down (I think, it may be rounded up). So it will only work on Rank 1 Spirits (Unless I'm wrong and it's rounded up in which case it will work on Rank 2 spirits as well).<br /> <br /> Spirit 5 doesn't work for the same reason that Spirit 4 doesn't work.</div> </div> </div> </div>How do you get this rule? I do not seen this in any Legacy related one in corebook.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-02T11:53:27-08:00","id":1025514,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1025175-2e-fan-skalds?p=1025508#post1025508\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, we can use Temporal Sympathies with a spell as it is - Temporal Attainment does not use Reach, from the rules as written.<br /> And, as I pointed - it's taken as 1E power in the unique Attainement rule. It's also <b>much</b> weaker than 4th dot Mind spell you have in mind as it is limited to and only Aspiration change.<br /> Made performance at site you want to preserve. Make sure it's past will be not changed.<br /> Will be changed in next iteration of Attainments.<br /> How do you get this rule? I do not seen this in any Legacy related one in corebook.</div> </div> </div> </div>Temporal Sympathy still requires a Reach spent to get Sensory Range since the Past is beyond your sensor range.<br /> <br /> The 4th dot spell Psychic Reprogramming allows for Aspiration Changes so this attainment is at least as powerful as that and shouldn't be at 3 dots.<br /> <br /> Making a performance at a site whose history you want to preserve won't preserve its past but the performance that you're giving at the site. You could preserve its past if you were using it as a Combined Spell/Attainment that affects the past, but since that's not what you're doing this power doesn't work the way you want it to.<br /> <br /> Page 198 in the Automatic Activation section <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> When required, the Attainment is also considered to have acquired additional spell factors that would incur a penalty (if cast as a spell) up to the Attainment\u2019s lowest prerequisite Arcanum. </div> </div> </div> Since that's spell factors incurred by penalty for secondary spell factors then you can only subtract up to 5 dice (When you're a Master) for penalty induced spell factors. Spell factors only care about every 2 dice incurred as a penalty for a bump up so with Potency as a secondary factor you'll get 1 automatically for activating the attainment and be able (When an Adept or Master) to automatically achieve another 2 Potency giving you Potency 3 and the ability to command Rank 2 spirits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-02T13:50:51-08:00","id":1025553,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1025175-2e-fan-skalds?p=1025514#post1025514\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Temporal Sympathy still requires a Reach spent to get Sensory Range since the Past is beyond your sensor range.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is this from official ruling by devs or are you just writting your personal interpretation? Cause in corebook I did not see any Temporal Spells needing Reach.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1025175-2e-fan-skalds?p=1025514#post1025514\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The 4th dot spell Psychic Reprogramming allows for Aspiration Changes so this attainment is at least as powerful as that and shouldn't be at 3 dots.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, <i>Psychic Reprogramming</i> make possible to change your Aspirations, Obsessions, Virtue, Vice, Conditions and Social and Mental Skills dots, all on in one casting, however the mage want. I say changing only <u>one Aspiration into very specific one</u> is much, much, <b>much</b> weaker. And power is based on Legacy 1E write-up, having sense in whole it's theme. This thing is not connected to Supernal magic studies, it's more 'our Legacy is this kind special'.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1025175-2e-fan-skalds?p=1025514#post1025514\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Making a performance at a site whose history you want to preserve won't preserve its past but the performance that you're giving at the site. You could preserve its past if you were using it as a Combined Spell/Attainment that affects the past, but since that's not what you're doing this power doesn't work the way you want it to.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, I rewrite it's then so this also be special power - as it has sense here.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1025175-2e-fan-skalds?p=1025514#post1025514\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Page 198 in the Automatic Activation section Since that's spell factors incurred by penalty for secondary spell factors then you can only subtract up to 5 dice (When you're a Master) for penalty induced spell factors. Spell factors only care about every 2 dice incurred as a penalty for a bump up so with Potency as a secondary factor you'll get 1 automatically for activating the attainment and be able (When an Adept or Master) to automatically achieve another 2 Potency giving you Potency 3 and the ability to command Rank 2 spirits.</div> </div> </div> </div>Will look into this math then on next iteration.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-02T13:50:51-08:00","id":1025554,"title":"","content":"( Double post, sorry )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-02-2017, 04:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-02T14:01:53-08:00","id":1025557,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1025175-2e-fan-skalds?p=1025553#post1025553\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is this from official ruling by devs or are you just writting your personal interpretation? Cause in corebook I did not see any Temporal Spells needing Reach.</div> </div> </div> </div>They need to have Reach spent to cast at Sensory Range and you haven't done that and it's right there in the text for using the Temporal Sympathy attainment. The way you have Postcognition set up right now you can only view the Unchanged past of a subject, i.e. very little time having passed at all.<br /> <br /> I still think the Mind 3 attainment is inappropriate because it's not a matter of it being weaker but being the wrong Practice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-02T14:56:03-08:00","id":1025577,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1025175-2e-fan-skalds?p=1025557#post1025557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They need to have Reach spent to cast at Sensory Range and you haven't done that and it's right there in the text for using the Temporal Sympathy attainment. The way you have Postcognition set up right now you can only view the Unchanged past of a subject, i.e. very little time having passed at all.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, I re-readed section both Time and Space Sympathy Attainments and now I get it. Will look into adding needed sensory Reach then to them.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1025175-2e-fan-skalds?p=1025557#post1025557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I still think the Mind 3 attainment is inappropriate because it's not a matter of it being weaker but being the wrong Practice.</div> </div> </div> </div>Change of one Aspiration is 'little change' so it's totally in the area of Mind 3 Weaving Practice:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MtAw, p. 123</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Weaving spells can alter nearly any property of a target without transforming it into something completely different. Solid steel can be transmuted to liquid (Matter), a sword can be enchanted to damage beings in Twilight (Death or Spirit), or a few seconds of time can be rewritten (Time).</div> </div> </div> </div>Weaving do not change whole Mind ( i.e. personality ) of the person - only one of it's many drives. It's 'change of one Aspiration' to the Mind Arcanum all over it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-02T15:21:46-08:00","id":1025591,"title":"","content":"Third version of Skalds Attainments...<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Attainments</span></b><br /> Three \u2018schools\u2019 in Legacy teaches their versions of Attainments. All of them agree on Mind Arcanum parts of their Art \u2013 they only change on secondary goal of their magic. Once Skald has mastered Attainment with particular Optional Arcanum, all his next Attainments must use the same Optional Arcanum \u2013 even if he can change particular powers, as self-created. Each new Attainment is learned by making next great masterpiece with entwined magic in the life of Skald. If Attainment has casting time of scene, Skald can use it as part of his performance and anybody listening is target of the power. Performance scene must take at least 30 minutes to up to 2 hours ( most take about an hour ), depending on content.<br /> <br /> <b>First Attainment: Preconcert<br /> Prerequisites: </b>Initiation<br /> There takes only one short song or poem to understand moods of your audience. With using Concentration while performing before his listeners, he can use <i>Mental Scan</i> to get general mood of his audience. Skald can ask up to Mind dots of questions from <i>Mental Scan</i> spell.<br /> <br /> <b>Optional 1:</b> Spirit 1<br /> Instant cast <i>Know Spirit </i>with Potency as Spirit dots of Skald.<br /> <b>Optional 2:</b> Death 1<br /> Instant cast <i>Know Ghost </i>( analogical to <i>Know Spirit</i> ) with Potency as Death dots of Skald.<br /> <b>Optional 3:</b> Time 1<br /> Instant cast <i>Perfect Timing</i>, preparing Skald for best starting performance.<br /> <br /> <b>Second Attainment: Soothe the Beast</b><br /> <b>Prerequisites: </b>Gnosis 2, Mind 2, Expression 3<br /> Skald can move people by his Art. Simply letting them to listen to his performance, he can use <i>Emotional Urging</i> on any listener of him, changing their minds to only one target state. It takes scene to use, but targeted listeners are under it\u2019s with Advanced Duration equal to his Mind dots.<br /> <br /> <b>Optional 1:</b> Spirit 2<br /> Scene cast <i>Command Spirit </i>with Potency and Advance Duration equal to Spirit dots of Skald.<br /> <b>Optional 2:</b> Death 2<br /> Scene cast <i>Touch of the Grave</i> for Advance Duration equal to Death dots of Skald.<br /> <b>Optional 3:</b> Time 2<br /> Scene cast <i>Postcognition</i> on audience, with Potency as Time dots of Skald. It\u2019s using sensory ranger for Temporal Sympathy. Listeners are thinking they are imaging visions they see themselves by moving art of Skald.<br /> <br /> <b>Third Attainment: Pride Goeth Before</b><br /> <b>Prerequisites:</b> Gnosis 4, Mind 3, Expression 3, Secondary Skill at 3<br /> Many times, it is not enough to make a person feel shame at their actions. The Hierarch may know the feelings to be false, or she may discard the emotion as a mere twinge of the conscience. When a person cannot be made to repent, it is the Skald\u2019s duty to force that person to admit fault and accept punishment, or leave for the better of the Consilium. Using this Attainment requires the Skald to perform a critical song or poem, or to plan and put on a satirical mummery or a play. In some way, he must communicate to the intended target and to those around her the failings and flaws they should see. Target has changed one of his Aspirations to \u2018Repent for mistakes\u2019 for the Advanced Duration equal to Mind dots of Skald. Attainment cast in the performance scene.<br /> <br /> <b>Optional 1:</b> Spirit 3<br /> Scene cast <i>Place of Power </i>with Potency and Advanced Duration equal to Spirit dots of Skald.<br /> <b>Optional 2:</b> Death 3<br /> Scene cast <i>Resolve Anchor </i>with Potency equal to Death dots of Skald.<br /> <br /> <b>Resolve Anchor</b> (Death \u2022\u2022\u2022)<br /> <b>Practice:</b> Fraying<br /> <b>Primary Factor:</b> Potency<br /> <b>Withstand:</b> Ghost\u2019s Rank<br /> <b>Suggested Rote Skills:</b> Academics, Occult, Expression<br /> Merciful Disciples of Death can make ghosts free of their existence burden and just unravel their connection to material world, one by one, letting them pass to Afterlife. It works as taking out Anchors of ghost in question. Each connection is treated as one Target for the spell, so mage is taking multiple of them by rising Scale Factor. Note that sorcerer only destroys ghosts connection to Anchor, not the Anchor itself \u2013 so shades can be sure nothing bad will happen to their close ones or the things close to their life. Mage is aware of Anchors being over ghost, but to know where they are connected, he needs to use spells like <i>Know Ghost</i>.<br /> <br /> <b>Optional 3:</b> Time 3<br /> Skalds being Disciples of Time can froze past of the site he is performing tale in it\u2019s current vision if his performance is adequate to this past. It works as Constant Presence spell, only cast on the Duration of Time dots for the Skald has \u2013 but cast by the Temporal Sympathy to the past period Skald is making performance. Until someone will win with Skald on the Clash of Wills, trying to change the past of the site, it\u2019s saved by the magics of his Art.<br /> <br /> <b>Fourth Attainment: Hearing the Kind Piper<br /> Prerequisites:</b> Gnosis 6, Mind 4, Expression 4<br /> Finally, some societies are too sick with corruption to do their own healing, or too weak-willed to correct the ill tendencies of neglectful superiors. When that is the case, the Skalds must drive people to cure themselves, to do what they are otherwise unwilling to do and begin the process of recovery. This Attainment requires an scene to perform, and its power carries through an appropriate recitation or song. Woven through the art is a deeply concealed, strong mental suggestion.<br /> It works as scene cast <i>Psychic Domination</i> with +2 Reach option of total control on target for fulfilling command up to Advanced Duration in Mind dots of Skald. Commanding people in this way is not obvious. Observers perceive the singing or the poetry, and then the target of the Attainment acts.<br /> <br /> <b>Optional 1:</b> Spirit 4<br /> Scene cast <i>Spirit Summons</i> with +1 Reach simple command option, +1 Reach option to summon from across Gauntlet, Potency equal to Spirit dots of Skald and Duration Factor equal 3 \u2013 that is total of 5 turns.<br /> <b>Optional 2:</b> Death 4<br /> Scene cast<i> Exorcism</i> with +1 Reach on preventing recreation of Conditions with Potency and Duration equal to Death dots of Skald.<br /> <b>Optional 3:</b> Time 4<br /> Scene cast <i>Temporal Summoning</i> with Advanced Duration and Potency equal to Time dots of Skald.<br /> <br /> <b>Fifth Attainment: Catharsis<br /> Prerequisites:</b> Gnosis 8, Mind 5, Expression 4, Secondary Skill at 4<br /> Skalds Art move listeners so much, it literally change who they are. It works as <i>Psychic Reprogramming</i> cast on his audience, with Potency equal to his Mind dots. Changes are the same for each listener. Attainment is cast in scene.<br /> <br /> <b>Optional 1:</b> Spirit 5<br /> Scene cast <i>Shape Spirit</i>, by changing story of the being. It has Advanced Duration equal to Spirit dots of Skald. Potency for this attainment is only 3, so this many changes Skald can do on being by his story.<br /> <b>Optional 2:</b> Death 5<br /> Scene cast <i>Destroy Ghost</i>. Skalds believe they freeing damned souls by this.<br /> <br /> <b>Destroy Ghost </b>(Death \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022)<br /> <b>Practice:</b> Unmaking<br /> <b>Primary Factor:</b> Potency<br /> <b>Withstand:</b> Rank<br /> <b>Suggested Rote Skills:</b> Intimidation, Science, Weaponry<br /> The most fearsome spell in most necromancer\u2019s arsenal, this terrible magic utterly destroys a ghost. The target ghost may spend an Essence to roll Power + Finesse in a Clash of Wills, a last ditch attempt to reassert its existence through its Influences. If the spell is successfully cast, the spirit is instantly and utterly destroyed \u2014 even if it still has Essence, it does not retreat into hibernation, it is simply gone. Short of archmastery, this spell cannot affect ghosts of Rank 6 or higher.<br /> <br /> <b>Optional 3: </b>Time 5<br /> Scene cast <i>Temporal Summoning</i> using Temporal Sympathy with Advanced Duration and Potency equal to Time dots of Skald.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-02-2017, 06:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-02T15:56:34-08:00","id":1025603,"title":"","content":"The fourth and fifth Time attainments are exactly the same. By the way you realize Temporal Summoning doesn't bring back the dead anymore, right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-02T23:21:22-08:00","id":1025750,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1025175-2e-fan-skalds?p=1025603#post1025603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">By the way you realize Temporal Summoning doesn't bring back the dead anymore, right?</div> </div> </div> </div>It does not need - only the past buildings would be enough. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> New versions of Time Attainments:<br /> <br /> <b>Optional 3:</b> Time 4<br /> Scene cast <i>Temporal Summoning</i> with Potency equal to Time dots of Skald.<br /> <br /> <b>Optional 3: </b>Time 5<br /> Scene cast <i>Temporal Summoning</i> using Temporal Sympathy with Advanced Duration and Potency equal to Time dots of Skald.<br /> <br /> I'm thinking about making Time 4 version instant cast, just to make it more practical to be used. Like Time 4 can make you instant heal your comrades and Time 5 is used to bring back Ruins of Time Before, with whole play and all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T03:12:22-08:00","id":1025805,"title":"","content":"Time 4 you didn't spend any Reach at all, Time 5 you still have one more Reach to spend.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T03:18:31-08:00","id":1025811,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1025175-2e-fan-skalds?p=1025805#post1025805\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Time 4 you didn't spend any Reach at all, Time 5 you still have one more Reach to spend.</div> </div> </div> </div>I do not have ideas for those Reaches - maybe you have some?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T03:21:12-08:00","id":1025813,"title":"","content":"Time 4 Advanced Duration, Temporal Sympathy<br /> <br /> Time 5 different attainment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T03:23:50-08:00","id":1025815,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1025175-2e-fan-skalds?p=1025813#post1025813\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Time 5 different attainment.</div> </div> </div> </div>Do not have idea on this in theme of 'restoring Lost Glory'. Any ideas?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T03:30:47-08:00","id":1025818,"title":"","content":"Not really. I'd consider making another attainment in the middle that enhances the more mundane side of the performance and bumping everything else up a slot. Or giving them Hung Spell that allows them to capture attainment uses so they can access their powers more quickly if necessary. Stuff like that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-19T13:20:58-08:00","id":1160624,"title":"","content":"I really like this write-up, especially the triple schools ideas. On a purely fluff note, I think we may call those after the three classical modes of bardic music:<br /> <br /> <b>Gentraige, </b>the mirthful, gleeful mode, for Skalds choosing Spirit as their Optional Arcanum. To them, Spirits are no more than other guests summoned to their festive shows - guests who sometimes, need to be reminded how they're supposed to behave, but who are so much fun...<br /> <br /> <b>Goltraige, </b>the mode of lamentations and complaints, for Skalds who choose the Death Arcanum. By reciting paeans about the dead, they prove them they are remembered here, and don't need to cling on the pale imitation of existence that is the ghostly condition.<br /> <br /> <b>Suantraige</b>, the sleep-inducing strain of music. This would have to be the Time School, whose visions-inducing or Attainments can easily make people question whether they're awake or dreaming.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11431-adrasalieth","name":"Adrasalieth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}